<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Servgro mulls unbundling, cautions holders.</title>
<headline>Servgro mulls unbundling, cautions holders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Servgro International Ltd said on Tuesday it was investigating a restructuring of the group which may include unbundling.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement in the first week of March.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
